## pluginHost.ts
@flow-hash: 49c2682e

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant PluginHost
    participant EventDispatcher
    participant PluginModule
    participant CSSManager
    participant ScriptRunner
    participant TriggerOmitStore
    participant DSLRenderer
    participant Fetch

    User->>PluginHost: enable(pluginId, userConfig)
    PluginHost->>PluginModule: normalizePluginModule(rawModule)
    PluginHost->>CSSManager: applyPluginBaseCss(connectionId, pluginId, css)
    PluginHost->>ScriptRunner: startPluginBundledScripts(pluginId, scripts, api)
    PluginHost->>EventDispatcher: ListenEvent(eventName, handler)
    PluginHost->>TriggerOmitStore: setPluginOmitRules(pluginId, rules)
    PluginHost->>PluginHost: store cleanup functions

    PluginHost->>PluginModule: call onEnable(api)
    PluginHost->>PluginModule: call onEvent(api, payload) for each ROUTED_WINDOW_EVENTS

    User->>PluginHost: tryExecuteAlias(input)
    PluginHost->>PluginModule: call onAlias(api, input)
    alt if plugin consumes command
        return true
    else
        return false
    end

    User->>PluginHost: invokePluginAction(pluginId, actionKey)
    PluginHost->>PluginModule: call registered action handler

    User->>PluginHost: disable(pluginId)
    PluginHost->>ScriptRunner: stopPluginBundledScripts()
    PluginHost->>EventDispatcher: removeEventListeners
    PluginHost->>CSSManager: removePluginBaseCss(connectionId, pluginId)
    PluginHost->>TriggerOmitStore: setPluginOmitRules(pluginId, [])
    PluginHost->>PluginHost: remove cleanup functions

    PluginHost->>PluginModule: call onDisable(api)
    PluginHost->>PluginHost: cleanup state

    PluginHost->>Fetch: httpGetJson(url, options)
    Fetch-->>PluginHost: JSON response

    PluginHost->>DSLRenderer: renderDslToAnsi(dslText)
    DSLRenderer-->>PluginHost: ANSI formatted text

    PluginHost->>EventDispatcher: DispatchEvent('shatteredarchive:write-terminal', ...)
    EventDispatcher->>Terminal: render text
```

Caption: Interaction flow.

## registry.ts
@flow-hash: 7b13f1d3

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Registry
    participant CorePluginModules

    Client->>Registry: Requests plugin by ID
    Registry->>Registry: Searches CORE_PLUGINS array
    Registry-->>Client: Returns CorePluginDefinition or undefined
    alt Plugin found
        Client->>CorePluginModules: Calls create() function
        CorePluginModules-->>Client: Returns IPluginModule instance
    end
```

Caption: The client requests a plugin by ID, the registry searches for it and returns a definition that can be instantiated into a module.
